# Legacy launcher list.
#
# The Start menu is built from freedesktop.org desktop entries now -- see
# ../Applications/ and Linux/WM_DesktopEntry.c -- and this file is only read
# when that scan finds nothing at all, which means a damaged or incomplete
# image. Keeping it means such an image still boots to a usable menu.
#
# Format: Name|Path|Badge|Category|Comment|Argument
#   Category is a wm_app_category_t ordinal (Core/WM_State.h):
#   0 system, 1 internet, 2 development, 3 graphics, 4 multimedia,
#   5 office, 6 game, 7 utility, 8 other. Everything after Badge is
#   optional; a three-field line written before those existed still parses.
Files|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.filemanager/com.ImplusOS.filemanager.ELF|FM|7|ファイルとフォルダーを開く
Editor|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.editor/com.ImplusOS.editor.ELF|ED|7|テキストファイルを編集する
Terminal|/Userland/Terminal/Terminal.ELF|TE|7|Linux ABI 上の xterm
BusyBox|/Userland/BusyBox/BusyBox.ELF|BB|7|ネイティブのシェルセッション
Doom|/Userland/Doom/Doom.ELF|DM|6|無改変の linuxxdoom
Chromium|/Userland/Chromium/Chromium.ELF|CR|1|無改変の Linux 版 Chromium
FireFox|/Userland/FireFox/FireFox.ELF|FX|1|無改変の Linux 版 FireFox
GTK3 Demo|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.gtk3demo/com.ImplusOS.gtk3demo.ELF|GK|2|GTK3 ウィジェット集|/usr/bin/gtk3-demo
Wayland Compositor|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.waylandcompositor/com.ImplusOS.waylandcompositor.ELF|WL|0|Wayland ディスプレイサーバ
FastFetch|/Userland/FastFetch/FastFetch.ELF|FF|0|システム情報表示
Serial Monitor|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.serialmonitor/com.ImplusOS.serialmonitor.ELF|SM|0|COM1 デバッグ出力
Settings|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.settings/com.ImplusOS.settings.ELF|ST|0|配色とシステム情報
Calculator|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.calculator/com.ImplusOS.calculator.ELF|Ca|7|式で計算する電卓
Process Manager|/Userland/com.ImplusOS.processmanager/com.ImplusOS.processmanager.ELF|PM|0|実行中のプロセスを確認して終了する
